        "喜びと恐れの二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Joy , plu:Fear .
plu:Curiosity a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Curiosity"@en , "好奇心"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of trust and surprise (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "信頼と驚きの二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Trust , plu:Surprise .
plu:Despair a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Despair"@en , "絶望"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of fear and sadness (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "恐れと悲しみの二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Fear , plu:Sadness .
plu:Unbelief a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Unbelief"@en , "不信"@ja ; skos:altLabel "Shock"@en ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of surprise and disgust (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "驚きと嫌悪の二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Surprise , plu:Disgust .
plu:Envy a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Envy"@en , "羨望"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of sadness and anger (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "悲しみと怒りの二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Sadness , plu:Anger .
plu:Cynicism a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Cynicism"@en , "冷笑"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of disgust and anticipation (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "嫌悪と期待の二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Disgust , plu:Anticipation .
plu:Pride a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Pride"@en , "誇り"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of anger and joy (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "怒りと喜びの二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Anger , plu:Joy .
plu:Hope a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:SecondaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Hope"@en , "希望"@ja ; skos:altLabel "Fatalism"@en ;
    skos:definition "The secondary dyad of anticipation and trust (one step apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "期待と信頼の二次 dyad（wheel 上で1 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Anticipation , plu:Trust .

#################### Tertiary dyads (8) ####################
plu:Delight a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Delight"@en , "歓喜"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of joy and surprise (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "喜びと驚きの三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Joy , plu:Surprise .
plu:Sentimentality a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Sentimentality"@en , "感傷"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of trust and sadness (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "信頼と悲しみの三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Trust , plu:Sadness .
plu:Shame a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Shame"@en , "恥"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of fear and disgust (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "恐れと嫌悪の三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Fear , plu:Disgust .
plu:Outrage a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Outrage"@en , "憤慨"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of surprise and anger (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "驚きと怒りの三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Surprise , plu:Anger .
plu:Pessimism a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Pessimism"@en , "悲観"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of sadness and anticipation (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "悲しみと期待の三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Sadness , plu:Anticipation .
plu:Morbidness a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Morbidness"@en , "病的好奇"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of disgust and joy (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "嫌悪と喜びの三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Disgust , plu:Joy .
plu:Dominance a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Dominance"@en , "支配"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of anger and trust (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "怒りと信頼の三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Anger , plu:Trust .
plu:Anxiety a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:TertiaryDyad ;
    rdfs:label "Anxiety"@en , "懸念"@ja ;
    skos:definition "The tertiary dyad of anticipation and fear (two steps apart on the wheel)."@en ,
        "期待と恐れの三次 dyad（wheel 上で2 つおきの基本感情の組）。"@ja ;
    plu:hasComponentEmotion plu:Anticipation , plu:Fear .

#################### Derivation Rules（決定 7。infer_dyads.rq は min の規則だけで事例を作る）####################
plu:Rule_DyadMin a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Minimum Aggregation (TH=0.5)"@en , "dyad の最小値集約（TH=0.5）"@ja ;
    plu:thresholdParameter "0.5"^^xsd:float ; plu:aggregationFunction "min" ;
    skos:definition "Derivation rule that instantiates a dyad when both component emotions have intensity at or above 0.5, taking the minimum as the dyad intensity."@en ,
        "成分の 2 感情の強度がともに 0.5 以上のとき dyad の事例を作り、最小値を dyad の強度とする導出規則。"@ja .
plu:Rule_DyadMin_TH03 a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Minimum Aggregation (TH=0.3)"@en , "dyad の最小値集約（TH=0.3）"@ja ;
    plu:thresholdParameter "0.3"^^xsd:float ; plu:aggregationFunction "min" ;
    skos:definition "Variant of the dyad-minimum rule with activation threshold 0.3."@en , "閾値を 0.3 にした最小値集約の規則。"@ja .
plu:Rule_DyadMin_TH07 a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Minimum Aggregation (TH=0.7)"@en , "dyad の最小値集約（TH=0.7）"@ja ;
    plu:thresholdParameter "0.7"^^xsd:float ; plu:aggregationFunction "min" ;
    skos:definition "Variant of the dyad-minimum rule with activation threshold 0.7."@en , "閾値を 0.7 にした最小値集約の規則。"@ja .

# min（Gödel t-norm）の一般化。成分が反相関する dyad（例: pride = anger + joy）で min が崩壊するため、
# 補償的な集約と較正閾値を規則として形式化する（CombineEFOMoE 方向4）。SPARQL では事例を作らない（#15）。
plu:Rule_DyadGeoMean a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Geometric-Mean Aggregation (TH=0.5)"@en , "dyad の幾何平均集約（TH=0.5）"@ja ;
    plu:thresholdParameter "0.5"^^xsd:float ; plu:aggregationFunction "geometric_mean" ;
    skos:definition "sqrt(P(a)*P(b)) >= TH. Compensatory; monotone-equivalent to the product t-norm."@en ,
        "sqrt(P(a)*P(b)) >= TH。補償的で、積 t-norm と単調に同値。"@ja .
plu:Rule_DyadArithMean a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Arithmetic-Mean Aggregation (TH=0.5)"@en , "dyad の算術平均集約（TH=0.5）"@ja ;
    plu:thresholdParameter "0.5"^^xsd:float ; plu:aggregationFunction "arithmetic_mean" ;
    skos:definition "(P(a)+P(b))/2 >= TH. Fully compensatory (not a t-norm)."@en , "(P(a)+P(b))/2 >= TH。完全に補償的（t-norm ではない）。"@ja .
plu:Rule_DyadProduct a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Product Aggregation (TH=0.5)"@en , "dyad の積集約（TH=0.5）"@ja ;
    plu:thresholdParameter "0.5"^^xsd:float ; plu:aggregationFunction "product" ;
    skos:definition "P(a)*P(b) >= TH. Product t-norm."@en , "P(a)*P(b) >= TH。積 t-norm。"@ja .
plu:Rule_DyadMin_CalibratedTH a owl:NamedIndividual , plu:DerivationRule ;
    rdfs:label "Dyad Minimum Aggregation (validation-calibrated per-dyad TH)"@en , "dyad の最小値集約（dyad ごとに validation で較正した TH）"@ja ;
    plu:aggregationFunction "min" ;
    skos:definition "min(P(a),P(b)) >= TH_c where TH_c maximises F1 on the validation split for each dyad c. The concrete TH_c used by a derivation is recorded on the occurrence in the provenance KG."@en ,
        "min(P(a),P(b)) >= TH_c。TH_c は dyad c ごとに validation の F1 を最大にする値で、実際に使った値は provenance KG の事例に記録する。"@ja .
